msgid "Version 4.6.0"
msgstr "버전 4.6.0"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:5
msgid "Release Date: January 19, 2025"
msgstr "릴리스 날짜: 2025년 1월 19일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:7
msgid "**4.6.0 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.6.0 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:15
msgid "BREAKING"
msgstr "주요 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:18
msgid "Behavior Changes"
msgstr "동작 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:23 ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:212
#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:304
msgid "Exceptions"
msgstr "예외"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"The exception class has been redesigned. See :ref:`exception-design` for "
"details. The following breaking changes have been made accordingly:"
msgstr ""
"예외 클래스가 재설계되었습니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`exception-design`\\ 을 참조하세요. "
"이에 따라 다음과 같은 주요 변경사항이 적용되었습니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"``Validation::setRule()`` now throws "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\InvalidArgumentException`` instead of "
"``TypeError``."
msgstr ""
"``Validation::setRule()``\\ 은 이제 ``TypeError`` 대신 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\InvalidArgumentException``\\ 을 발생시킵니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:30
msgid ""
"``CriticalError`` now extends "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException`` instead of ``Error``."
msgstr ""
"``CriticalError``\\ 는 이제 ``Error`` 대신 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException``\\ 을 상속합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:32
msgid ""
"``DatabaseException`` now extends "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException`` instead of ``Error``."
msgstr ""
"``DatabaseException``\\ 은 이제 ``Error`` 대신 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException``\\ 을 상속합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:34
msgid ""
"``ConfigException`` now extends "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException`` instead of "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\CriticalError``."
msgstr ""
"``ConfigException``\\ 은 이제 ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\CriticalError`` 대신 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\RuntimeException``\\ 을 상속합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:36
msgid ""
"``TestException`` now extends ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\LogicException``"
" instead of ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\CriticalError``."
msgstr ""
"``TestException``\\ 은 이제 ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\CriticalError`` 대신 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\LogicException``\\ 을 상속합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:40
msgid "Filters Changes"
msgstr "필터 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:42
msgid ""
"The ``Filters`` class has been changed to allow multiple runs of the same"
" filter with different arguments in before or after. See :ref:`Upgrading "
"Guide <upgrade-460-filters-changes>` for details."
msgstr ""
"``Filters`` 클래스가 변경되어 before 또는 after에서 동일한 필터를 다른 인자로 여러 번 실행할 수 있게 되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`업그레이드 가이드 <upgrade-460-filters-changes>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:47
msgid "Registrars"
msgstr "레지스트라"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:49
msgid ""
"Added check to prevent Auto-Discovery of Registrars from running twice. "
"If it is executed twice, an exception will be thrown. See "
":ref:`upgrade-460-registrars-with-dirty-hack`."
msgstr ""
"레지스트라 자동 탐색이 두 번 실행되는 것을 방지하는 검사가 추가되었습니다. "
"두 번 실행되면 예외가 발생합니다. :ref:`upgrade-460-registrars-with-dirty-hack`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:54
msgid "Time::createFromTimestamp()"
msgstr "Time::createFromTimestamp()"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:56
msgid ""
"``Time::createFromTimestamp()`` handles timezones differently. If "
"``$timezone`` is not explicitly passed then the instance has timezone set"
" to UTC unlike earlier where the currently set default timezone was used."
" See :ref:`Upgrading Guide <upgrade-460-time-create-from-timestamp>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"``Time::createFromTimestamp()``\\ 는 타임존 처리 방식이 변경되었습니다. "
"``$timezone``\\ 을 명시적으로 전달하지 않으면, 이전에는 현재 설정된 기본 타임존이 사용되었지만 "
"이제는 UTC로 설정됩니다. 자세한 내용은 :ref:`업그레이드 가이드 <upgrade-460-time-create-from-timestamp>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:62
msgid "Time with Microseconds"
msgstr "마이크로초를 포함한 Time"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:64
msgid ""
"Fixed bugs that some methods in ``Time`` to lose microseconds have been "
"fixed. See :ref:`Upgrading Guide <upgrade-460-time-keeps-microseconds>` "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"``Time``\\ 의 일부 메서드에서 마이크로초가 손실되는 버그가 수정되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`업그레이드 가이드 <upgrade-460-time-keeps-microseconds>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:68
msgid "Time::setTimestamp()"
msgstr "Time::setTimestamp()"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:70
msgid ""
"``Time::setTimestamp()`` behavior has been fixed. See :ref:`Upgrading "
"Guide <upgrade-460-time-set-timestamp>` for details."
msgstr ""
"``Time::setTimestamp()``\\ 의 동작이 수정되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`업그레이드 가이드 <upgrade-460-time-set-timestamp>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:74
msgid "Error Reporting to Non-HTML Requests"
msgstr "비HTML 요청에 대한 오류 보고"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:76
msgid ""
"In previous versions, when a request does not accept HTML, CodeIgniter "
"showed error details only in the ``development`` and ``testing`` "
"environments."
msgstr ""
"이전 버전에서는 HTML을 허용하지 않는 요청이 들어올 때, CodeIgniter는 ``development`` 및 ``testing`` "
"환경에서만 오류 세부 정보를 표시했습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:79
msgid ""
"But because it is not possible to display error details when using a "
"custom environment, this behavior has been fixed so that error details "
"are displayed if ``display_errors`` in PHP ini setting is enabled."
msgstr ""
"하지만 사용자 정의 환경에서는 오류 세부 정보를 표시할 수 없었기 때문에, "
"PHP ini 설정의 ``display_errors``\\ 가 활성화된 경우 오류 세부 정보가 표시되도록 동작이 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:83
msgid ""
"With this fix, the error details are now displayed under the same "
"conditions for both HTML requests and non-HTML requests."
msgstr ""
"이 수정으로 인해 HTML 요청과 비HTML 요청 모두 동일한 조건에서 오류 세부 정보가 표시됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:87
msgid "Session ID (SID)"
msgstr "세션 ID (SID)"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:89
msgid ""
"Now ``Session`` library forces to use the PHP default 32 character SIDs, "
"with 4 bits of entropy per character. See :ref:`Upgrading Guide "
"<upgrade-460-sid-change>` for details."
msgstr ""
"이제 ``Session`` 라이브러리는 문자당 4비트의 엔트로피를 가진 PHP 기본 32자 SID 사용을 강제합니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`업그레이드 가이드 <upgrade-460-sid-change>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:96
msgid "Headers"
msgstr "헤더"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:98
msgid ""
"The headers set by the ``Response`` class replace those that can be set "
"by the PHP ``header()`` function."
msgstr ""
"``Response`` 클래스로 설정한 헤더가 PHP ``header()`` 함수로 설정된 헤더를 대체합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:101
msgid ""
"In previous versions, headers set by the ``Response`` class were added to"
" existing ones - giving no options to change them. That could lead to "
"unexpected behavior when the same headers were set with mutually "
"exclusive directives."
msgstr ""
"이전 버전에서는 ``Response`` 클래스로 설정한 헤더가 기존 헤더에 추가되어 변경할 방법이 없었습니다. "
"이로 인해 상호 배타적인 지시문으로 동일한 헤더가 설정된 경우 예기치 않은 동작이 발생할 수 있었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:105
msgid ""
"For example, session will automatically set headers with the ``header()``"
" function:"
msgstr ""
"예를 들어, 세션은 ``header()`` 함수로 자동으로 헤더를 설정합니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:113
msgid ""
"So if we set **Expires** header one more time we will end up with a "
"duplicated header:"
msgstr ""
"따라서 **Expires** 헤더를 한 번 더 설정하면 중복된 헤더가 생깁니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:120
msgid "Response headers:"
msgstr "응답 헤더:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:128
msgid ""
"Now, we don't know which one will be picked by the browser or which "
"header is the correct one. With changes in this version our previous "
"header will be overridden:"
msgstr ""
"이 경우 브라우저가 어떤 헤더를 선택할지, 어느 것이 올바른 헤더인지 알 수 없습니다. "
"이번 버전 변경으로 기존 헤더가 덮어씌워집니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:138
msgid "Interface Changes"
msgstr "인터페이스 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:140
msgid ""
"As long as you have not extended the relevant CodeIgniter core classes or"
" implemented these interfaces, all these changes are backward compatible "
"and require no intervention."
msgstr ""
"관련 CodeIgniter 핵심 클래스를 확장하거나 이 인터페이스를 구현하지 않은 경우, "
"이 모든 변경사항은 하위 호환성이 유지되므로 별도의 조치가 필요하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:144
msgid ""
"**Router:** The following methods have been added in "
"``RouteCollectionInterface``:"
msgstr ""
"**Router:** ``RouteCollectionInterface``\\ 에 다음 메서드가 추가되었습니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:146
msgid "``getDefaultNamespace()``"
msgstr "``getDefaultNamespace()``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:147
msgid "``getRoutesOptions()``"
msgstr "``getRoutesOptions()``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:148
msgid "``setHTTPVerb()``"
msgstr "``setHTTPVerb()``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:149
msgid "``isFiltered()``"
msgstr "``isFiltered()``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:150
msgid "``getFiltersForRoute()``"
msgstr "``getFiltersForRoute()``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:155
msgid "Method Signature Changes"
msgstr "메서드 시그니처 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:157
msgid ""
"**Router:** The constructor of the ``DefinedRouteCollector`` has been "
"changed. The ``RouteCollection`` typehint has been changed to "
"``RouteCollectionInterface``."
msgstr ""
"**Router:** ``DefinedRouteCollector``\\ 의 생성자가 변경되었습니다. "
"``RouteCollection`` 타입힌트가 ``RouteCollectionInterface``\\ 로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:159
msgid ""
"**View:** The return type of the ``renderSection()`` method has been "
"changed to ``string``, and now the method does not call ``echo``."
msgstr ""
"**View:** ``renderSection()`` 메서드의 반환 타입이 ``string``\\ 으로 변경되었으며, "
"이제 해당 메서드는 ``echo``\\ 를 호출하지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:161
msgid ""
"**Time:** The first parameter type of the ``createFromTimestamp()`` has "
"been changed from ``int`` to ``int|float``, and the return type "
"``static`` has been added."
msgstr ""
"**Time:** ``createFromTimestamp()``\\ 의 첫 번째 매개변수 타입이 ``int``\\ 에서 ``int|float``\\ 로 변경되었으며, "
"반환 타입 ``static``\\ 이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:164
msgid ""
"**Helpers:** ``character_limiter()`` parameter names have been updated. "
"If you use named arguments, you need to update the function calls."
msgstr ""
"**Helpers:** ``character_limiter()``\\ 의 매개변수 이름이 업데이트되었습니다. "
"명명된 인자를 사용하는 경우 함수 호출을 업데이트해야 합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:167
msgid "Removed Type Definitions"
msgstr "제거된 타입 정의"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:169
msgid "**Database:**"
msgstr "**Database:**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:170
msgid ""
"The type ``string`` of the first parameter in "
"``BaseConnection::escapeIdentifier()`` has been removed."
msgstr ""
"``BaseConnection::escapeIdentifier()``\\ 의 첫 번째 매개변수의 ``string`` 타입이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:172
msgid ""
"The type ``string`` of the first parameter in "
"``BaseConnection::getFieldNames()`` and "
"``SQLite3\\Connection::getFieldNames()`` have been removed."
msgstr ""
"``BaseConnection::getFieldNames()``\\ 와 ``SQLite3\\Connection::getFieldNames()``\\ 의 "
"첫 번째 매개변수의 ``string`` 타입이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:175
msgid ""
"The type ``string`` of the first parameter in "
"``BaseConnection::_listColumns()`` and "
"``MySQLi\\Connection::_listColumns()`` and "
"``OCI8\\Connection::_listColumns()`` and "
"``Postgre\\Connection::_listColumns()`` and "
"``SQLSRV\\Connection::_listColumns()`` and "
"``SQLite3\\Connection::_listColumns()`` have been removed."
msgstr ""
"``BaseConnection::_listColumns()``, ``MySQLi\\Connection::_listColumns()``, "
"``OCI8\\Connection::_listColumns()``, ``Postgre\\Connection::_listColumns()``, "
"``SQLSRV\\Connection::_listColumns()``, ``SQLite3\\Connection::_listColumns()``\\ 의 "
"첫 번째 매개변수의 ``string`` 타입이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:185
msgid "Removed Deprecated Items"
msgstr "제거된 사용 중단 항목"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:187
msgid ""
"**API:** The deprecated ``failValidationError()`` method in "
"``CodeIgniter\\API\\ResponseTrait`` has been removed. Use "
"``failValidationErrors()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**API:** ``CodeIgniter\\API\\ResponseTrait``\\ 의 사용 중단된 ``failValidationError()`` 메서드가 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``failValidationErrors()``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:189
msgid ""
"**HTTP:** The deprecated ``getReason()`` method in "
"``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Response`` and ``ResponseInterface`` has been "
"removed. Use ``getReasonPhrase()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**HTTP:** ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Response``\\ 와 ``ResponseInterface``\\ 의 사용 중단된 ``getReason()`` 메서드가 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``getReasonPhrase()``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Logger:** The deprecated ``CodeIgniter\\Log\\Logger::cleanFilenames()``"
" and ``CodeIgniter\\Test\\TestLogger::cleanup()`` have been removed. Use "
"the ``clean_path()`` function instead."
msgstr ""
"**Logger:** 사용 중단된 ``CodeIgniter\\Log\\Logger::cleanFilenames()``\\ 와 "
"``CodeIgniter\\Test\\TestLogger::cleanup()``\\ 이 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``clean_path()`` 함수를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:194
msgid ""
"**Router:** The deprecated "
"``CodeIgniter\\Router\\Exceptions\\RedirectException`` has been removed. "
"Use ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Exceptions\\RedirectException`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**Router:** 사용 중단된 ``CodeIgniter\\Router\\Exceptions\\RedirectException``\\ 이 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\Exceptions\\RedirectException``\\ 을 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:195
msgid ""
"**Constants:** The deprecated constants ``EVENT_PRIORITY_*`` in has been "
"removed. Use the class constants "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_LOW``, "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_NORMAL`` and "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_HIGH`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**Constants:** 사용 중단된 ``EVENT_PRIORITY_*`` 상수가 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 클래스 상수 ``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_LOW``, "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_NORMAL``, "
"``CodeIgniter\\Events\\Events::PRIORITY_HIGH``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:196
msgid ""
"**View:** The deprecated property "
"``CodeIgniter\\View\\View::$currentSection`` has been removed."
msgstr ""
"**View:** 사용 중단된 ``CodeIgniter\\View\\View::$currentSection`` 속성이 제거되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:197
msgid ""
"**Config:** The deprecated property ``Config\\Cache::$storePath`` has "
"been removed. Use ``Config\\Cache::$file['storePath']`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**Config:** 사용 중단된 ``Config\\Cache::$storePath`` 속성이 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``Config\\Cache::$file['storePath']``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:198
msgid ""
"**Formatter:** The deprecated ``Config\\Format::getFormatter()`` has been"
" removed. Use ``CodeIgniter\\Format\\Format::getFormatter()`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**Formatter:** 사용 중단된 ``Config\\Format::getFormatter()``\\ 가 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``CodeIgniter\\Format\\Format::getFormatter()``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:199
msgid ""
"**Security:** ``Config\\Security::$samesite`` has been removed. Use "
"``Config\\Cookie::$samesite`` instead."
msgstr ""
"**Security:** ``Config\\Security::$samesite``\\ 가 제거되었습니다. "
"대신 ``Config\\Cookie::$samesite``\\ 를 사용하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:200
msgid ""
"**Cookie:** Methods ``dispatch()``, ``setRawCookie()``, ``setCookie()`` "
"in ``CodeIgniter\\Cookie\\CookieStore`` has been removed. They are now "
"part of ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\ResponseTrait``."
msgstr ""
"**Cookie:** ``CodeIgniter\\Cookie\\CookieStore``\\ 의 ``dispatch()``, ``setRawCookie()``, ``setCookie()`` 메서드가 제거되었습니다. "
"이 메서드들은 이제 ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\ResponseTrait``\\ 의 일부입니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:204
msgid "Enhancements"
msgstr "개선사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:207
msgid "Publisher"
msgstr "Publisher"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:209
msgid ""
"``Publisher::discover()`` now accepts a second parameter (``namespace``) "
"specifying the namespace in which publishers should be searched. See :ref"
":`discovery-in-a-specific-namespace` for the details."
msgstr ""
"``Publisher::discover()``\\ 는 이제 두 번째 매개변수(``namespace``)를 허용하여 "
"퍼블리셔를 검색할 네임스페이스를 지정할 수 있습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`discovery-in-a-specific-namespace`\\ 를 참조하세요."

