msgstr ""
"``LogicException``\\ 을 발생시키던 클래스들이 ``CodeIgniter\\Exceptions\\LogicException``\\ 을 발생시키도록 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.6.0.rst:319
msgid ""
"Classes that threw ``BadMethodCallException`` have been changed to throw "
